#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel2_3)
#: ksecretd/kwalletwizardpageexplanation.ui:17
#, fuzzy, kde-format
#| msgid ""
#| "<html><head/><body><p>The KDE Wallet system stores your data in a <span "
#| "style=\" font-style:italic;\">wallet</span> file on your local hard disk. "
#| "The data is only written in the encrypted form of your choice - blowfish "
#| "algorithm with your password as the key or using a GPG encryption key. "
#| "When a wallet is opened, the wallet manager application will launch and "
#| "display an icon in the system tray. You can use this application to "
#| "manage all of your wallets. It even permits you to drag wallets and "
#| "wallet contents, allowing you to easily copy a wallet to a remote system."
#| "</p></body></html>"
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body><p>The KDE Wallet system stores your data in a <span "
"style=\" font-style:italic;\">wallet</span> file on your local hard disk. "
"The data is encrypted using your chosen method: the Blowfish algorithm with "
"your password as the key, or GPG with an encryption key. When a wallet is "
"opened, the wallet manager will launch and display an icon in the system "
"tray. You can use this application to manage all of your wallets. It even "
"permits you to drag-and-drop wallets and their contents, allowing you to "
"easily copy a wallet to a remote system.</p></body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body><p>The KDE Wallet system stores your data in a <span "
"style=\" font-style:italic;\">wallet</span> file on your local hard disk. "
"The data is only written in the encrypted form of your choice - blowfish "
"algorithm with your password as the key or using a GPG encryption key. When "
"a wallet is opened, the wallet manager application will launch and display "
"an icon in the system tray. You can use this application to manage all of "
"your wallets. It even permits you to drag wallets and wallet contents, "
"allowing you to easily copy a wallet to a remote system.</p></body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_3)
#: ksecretd/kwalletwizardpagegpgkey.ui:24
#, fuzzy, kde-format
#| msgid ""
#| "<html><head/><body><p>The GPG-based wallet use a GPG encryption key to "
#| "securely encrypt data on disk. The key must be available when decrypting "
#| "is needed or your wallet will not be accessible. For example, if you "
#| "choose a SmartCard-based encryption key, the GPG system will prompt you "
#| "to enter it and its associated PIN when attempting to open the wallet. "
#| "<span style=\" font-weight:600;\">NOTE:</span> this list contains only "
#| "&quot;ultimate-level&quot; trusted keys.</p></body></html>"
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body><p>The GPG-based wallet uses a GPG encryption key to "
"securely encrypt data on disk. The key must be available when the wallet is "
"decrypted or your wallet will not be accessible. For example, if you choose "
"a SmartCard-based encryption key, you will be prompted to insert it and "
"enter its associated PIN when attempting to open the wallet. <span style=\" "
"font-weight:600;\">Note:</span> this list contains only &quot;ultimate-"
"level&quot; trusted keys.</p></body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body><p>The GPG-based wallet use a GPG encryption key to "
"securely encrypt data on disk. The key must be available when decrypting is "
"needed or your wallet will not be accessible. For example, if you choose a "
"SmartCard-based encryption key, the GPG system will prompt you to enter it "
"and its associated PIN when attempting to open the wallet. <span style=\" "
"font-weight:600;\">NOTE:</span> this list contains only &quot;ultimate-"
"level&quot; trusted keys.</p></body></html>"

